cked mill. The integer in CAP.txt is the packed mill ceiling. Extra slips under /app/slipcards, including /app/slipcards/held.kmsg and /app/slipcards/veil.card,
 follow the same packed-taste rule as the named cards. Ops sometimes floor a mill by dropping unused booths from the packed set.
